OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother largely sunny and dry
OL,6,Fday for most, although just a low risk
OL,7,Fof isolated thundery showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping later in the day. Still
OL,9,Ffeeling hot with mainly light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry with variable
OL,12,Fcloud and clear spells, although still
OL,13,Fthe chance of isolated thundery
OL,14,Fshowers. Feeling warm and rather muggy
OL,15,Ffor most, especially in urban areas.
OL,16,FWinds mainly light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
